{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"87902","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/87902","key":"MC-264829","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"13/Aug/23 10:40 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>if a player with the account text filter disabled* makes a sign with a line that gets fully filtered by the text-filter-config specified in server.properties (either since it exceeds hashes to drop, or the \"hashed\" key in the response doesn't exist), then the line is shown to players with the text filter enabled, even though the line should be fully hidden.</p>\n\n<p>this is due to an empty component in the filtered_message defaulting to messages,</p>\n\n<p>which while correct if the message is fully allowed, is incorrect if the whole line should be empty for users playing with the text filter</p>\n<h1><a name=\"Reproduction\"></a>Reproduction</h1>\n<ol>\n\t<li>have a webserver providing text-filtering. i have made <a href=\"https://textfilter-server.the456gamer.workers.dev/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://textfilter-server.the456gamer.workers.dev/</a> as a demo, use <a href=\"https://textfilter-server.the456gamer.workers.dev/exampleconfig\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://textfilter-server.the456gamer.workers.dev/exampleconfig</a> to copy the text-filtering-config**</li>\n\t<li>ensure the dedicated server is running, with the text-filter-config set to the right url, and hashes to drop being 0 (so every text would cause it to be empty)</li>\n\t<li>on an account with textfilter <b>disabled</b>,* place a sign with a line that gets filtered</li>\n\t<li>on an account with textfilter <b>enabled</b>, observe that the sign contains the line that should be filtered</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>tested with the following sign</p>\n\n<p><tt>123: filtered line</tt><br>\n<tt>abc: unfiltered lin</tt><br>\n<tt>semi-filtered line</tt></p>\n\n<p>with the filter:</p>\n\n<p>if line contains \"abc\": never filter</p>\n\n<p>if line contains \"123\": always fully filter</p>\n\n<p>else: filter every character</p>\n\n<p>placed on unfiltered client, viewed on filtered client</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/114157\" height=\"173\" width=\"321\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></span></p>\n\n<p>placed on filtered client, viewed on filtered client (what both should look like on filtered client)</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/114156\" height=\"172\" width=\"320\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></span></p>\n\n<p>*: this is needed as otherwise the filtered text will be placed into the messages: tag, not filtered_messages where the fallback exists</p>\n\n<p>**: this logs the requests to discord, see root url for more info</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"14/Aug/23 7:36 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/114156","id":"114156","filename":"image-2023-08-13-18-36-00-618.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"The456gamer","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"customer"},"created":"13/Aug/23 10:36 AM","size":"30 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/114156","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/114156"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/114157","id":"114157","filename":"image-2023-08-13-18-36-54-159.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"The456gamer","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"customer"},"created":"13/Aug/23 10:36 AM","size":"30 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/114157","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/114157"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"14/Aug/23 12:36 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"20/Aug/26 4:32 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Text Filter on signs doesn't hide if fully filtered","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-264829/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2023-08-13T10:40:32.747-0700","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":null,"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"conte